atus.JPG", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Aetosaurus_ferratus.JPG/960px-Aetosaurus_ferratus.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aetosaurus_ferratus.JPG", "artist": "Ghedoghedo", "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0", "date": "Aug 2010 -", "caption": "Aetosaurus ferratus specimen.", "w": 2816, "h": 2112, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}, {"kind": "fossil", "file": "Aetosaurus many specimens.jpg", "src": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Aetosaurus_many_specimens.jpg/960px-Aetosaurus_many_specimens.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aetosaurus_many_specimens.jpg", "artist": "Ghedoghedo", "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "licurl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0", "date": "2015-08-19", "caption": "Slab with many Aetosaurus individuals.", "w": 3233, "h": 1507, "local": null, "review": "unreviewed"}], "sources": [{"kind": "original", "text": "Fraas, O. 1877. ''Aetosaurus ferratus'' Fr. Die gepanzerte Vogel-Echse aus dem Stubensandstein bei Stuttgar. Festschrift zur Feier des 400jährigen Jubiläums der Eberhard-Karls-Universät zu Tübingen, Wurttembergische Naturwissenschaftliche Jahreshefte 33(3): 1–22."}, {"kind": "literature", "text": "Heckert, A.B. 1999. A new aetosaur (Reptilia: Archosauria) from the Upper Triassic of Texas and the phylogeny of aetosaurs. Journal of Vertebrate Paleontology 19(1): 50–68. doi:10.1080/02724634.1999.10011122"}, {"kind": "literature", "text": "Teschner, Elżbieta M.; Konietzko-Meier, Dorota; Desojo, Julia B.; Schoch, Rainer R.; Klein, Nicole 2023. Triassic Nursery? Evidence of gregarious behavior in juvenile pseudosuchian archosaurs as inferred by humeral histology of Aetosaurus ferratus (Norian; southern Germany). Journal of Vert